# Loaded by `npm run dev` only. Committed on purpose: a fresh clone should be
# able to run the panel against a local XAMPP backend without hand-writing an
# env file. Production values never live here — see .env.example.
#
# This said https://serbis-api.onrender.com/api until 2026-08-31, which meant
# `npm run dev` drove PRODUCTION: a teammate running the dev server and clicking
# Approve or Deny mutated live resident data. The comment above was always the
# intent; only the value was wrong. Point it anywhere but production.
VITE_API_BASE=http://localhost:8000/api
